WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:05.540
With Warner Brothers' decision to simultaneously
release their 2021 slate of films in theaters

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:10.620
and on HBO Max, there's lots to look forward
to from the comfort of your own home.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:15.120
From sci-fi spectacles to prestige dramas
and documentaries, here are the must-watch

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.660
movies coming to HBO Max in 2021 and beyond.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:24.750
Mortal Kombat fans have been not-so-patiently
waiting for nearly 25 years for another Mortal

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.530
Kombat movie to be released in theaters.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:32.099
Video game movies have a track record of being
subpar, and Mortal Kombat certainly has a

00:00:32.099 --> 00:00:34.170
part to play in that history.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:37.989
Not counting the direct-to-video release of
Mortal Kombat Legends: Scorpion's Revenge

00:00:37.989 --> 00:00:43.909
in 2020, the last Mortal Kombat movie was
the poorly received Mortal Kombat: Annihilation

00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:45.819
in 1997.

00:00:45.819 --> 00:00:50.929
Even as a sequel to the beloved 1995 original
film, Annihilation was enough of a failure

00:00:50.929 --> 00:00:54.379
to completely end the Mortal Kombat film franchise.

00:00:54.379 --> 00:00:55.910
Until now.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:01:00.850
Ever since Warner Brothers acquired Midway
Games in 2009, fans have been anticipating

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:07.370
a new Mortal Kombat, which is finally hitting
theaters and HBO Max on April 23, 2021.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:09.460
"Get over here!"

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:13.640
The movie is getting off on the right foot
by casting martial arts and stunt professionals

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:17.740
from across the globe, including Lewis Tan
and Joe Taslim.

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:23.880
And along with actors such as Mehcad Brooks,
Jessica McNamee, Josh Lawson, and Hiroyuki

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:28.170
Sanada, the cast is a good indicator that
the new Mortal Kombat is fully embracing the

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:31.359
fantasy franchise's martial arts tournament
roots.

00:01:31.359 --> 00:01:36.119
The trailers so far aren't showing too much
about the story, but if nothing else, expect

00:01:36.119 --> 00:01:39.789
some impressive stunts and intricately choreographed
hand-to-hand fights.

00:01:40.789 --> 00:01:45.770
If you're a fan of dark, modern-day Westerns,
then keep your eyes on HBO Max.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:50.299
Those Who Wish Me Dead is based on the novel
of the same title, one written by Michael

00:01:50.299 --> 00:01:53.350
Koryta and published in 2014.

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:57.210
Koryta is one of the credited screenwriters
on the project, alongside Charles Leavitt

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.780
and director Taylor Sheridan.

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:04.050
Those Who Wish Me Dead stars Angelina Jolie
and Nicholas Hoult in lead roles, along with

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:07.700
Tyler Perry, Aidan Gillen and Jon Bernthal.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:12.220
Filmed in New Mexico, the movie is actually
set in the wilderness of Montana, in a forest

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:14.110
threatened by wildfires.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:19.280
This white-knuckle thriller finds a teenage
murder witness being pursued by twin assassins.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:23.620
Needless to say, that's not a great situation
to find yourself in, but at least this teen

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:27.360
has the assistance of a survival expert tasked
with protecting him.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.890
Those Who Wish Me Dead is sure to be an intense
ride for its characters while also being a

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.420
commentary on the state of the environment.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.833
The film is set to hit HBO Max and theaters
on May 14, 2021.

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:43.560
The Conjuring universe has grown a lot since
we were first introduced to the world of the

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.260
Warrens in 2013.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:49.920
Since then, we've met the likes of La Llorona
and Valak, and we've run into that creepy

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.260
Annabelle doll on more than one occasion.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:56.730
Now, we're returning to the main storyline
with the eighth film in the franchise — The

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.970
Conjuring: The Devil Made Me Do It.

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:03.900
Patrick Wilson and Vera Farmiga are returning
as real-life paranormal investigators and

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.490
authors Ed and Lorraine Warren.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:10.760
Originally scheduled for a September 2020
release, The Devil Made Me Do It was delayed

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:15.080
due to COVID-19 and will now be out June 4,
2021.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:19.560
It's directed by relative newcomer Michael
Chaves, who is best known to Conjuring fans

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:24.610
as the director of The Curse of La Llorona,
the sixth film in the Conjuring universe.

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:29.110
The Devil Made Me Do It is based on the trial
of Arne Cheyenne Johnson, who was the first

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:32.870
murder suspect to ever claim demonic possession
as a defense.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:37.570
The 1981 case also involved the possession
of an 11-year-old boy, which is certain to

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.900
be the source of many scares in the upcoming
Conjuring film.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.260
The Devil Made Me Do It hits HBO Max June
4, 2021.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:50.260
Before Hamilton, In the Heights was the musical
that put Lin-Manuel Miranda on the Broadway

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:51.260
map.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:55.181
Featuring his characteristic pop-rap style
of songwriting, the story of his first show

00:03:55.181 --> 00:03:58.700
is much more grounded than the bombastic historical
hit.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:02.760
A community in Washington Heights has to deal
with the sweltering heat of a New York summer

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.060
while working through issues of family, race,
and class.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:07.710
"They're talking about kicking out all the
Dreamers.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:10.420
It's time to make some noise."

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:15.500
The film adaptation of In the Heights is directed
by Jon M. Chu, and features one of Hamilton's

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.090
youngest stars, Anthony Ramos, in the lead
role.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:23.090
Originally scheduled to be released in the
summer of 2020, In the Heights will finally

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:27.375
release in theaters and on HBO Max on June
11, 2021.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:32.680
For decades now, fans have been clamoring
for a sequel to Space Jam.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:37.190
The 1996 Looney Tunes and Michael Jordan crossover
is still the highest-grossing basketball movie

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:41.760
of all time, begging the question of why it's
taken so long for Hollywood to make a new

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.840
installment.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:47.890
But in 2021, Space Jam: A New Legacy will
finally bring the Space Jam magic to a new

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:48.890
generation.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:53.090
This time, the basketball star at the center
of the story is LeBron James.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:58.030
Trapped in a virtual reality space with his
son by a rogue A.I., played by Don Cheadle,

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:01.940
James has to team up with the Looney Toons
to beat a team of elite basketball-playing

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:02.940
algorithms.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:07.720
Directed by Malcolm D. Lee and produced by
Ryan Coogler, Space Jam: A New Legacy is sure

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:10.090
to be a blast for families and kids.

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:13.730
Even if you're not a fan of Bugs Bunny and
company, there will be something for everyone

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:18.810
in this wacky flick, as James' journey through
virtual reality will tie into other Warner

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:22.320
Brothers films such as Casablanca and Mad
Max: Fury Road.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:24.670
The game starts on July 16, 2021.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:30.790
Written and directed by Guardians of the Galaxy
director James Gunn, The Suicide Squad serves

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:34.910
as a soft reboot of the 2016 film of nearly
the same name.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:40.270
While the 2021 film keeps Margot Robbie as
Harley Quinn, as well as Joel Kinnaman's Rick

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:45.750
Flag, Viola Davis' Amanda Waller, and Jai
Courtney's Captain Boomerang, the majority

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:49.280
of the 2016 cast isn't returning for the new
film.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:54.130
Instead, the movie is opting for a fresh start,
with new actors playing new characters.

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:59.570
The impressive and eclectic cast of The Suicide
Squad includes Idris Elba as Bloodsport, John

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:04.580
Cena as Peacemaker, Sylvester Stallone as
King Shark, Michael Rooker as Savant, and

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:08.150
Pete Davidson as Blackguard, among a host
of other actors.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:13.220
A spinoff show starring John Cena's Peacemaker
is already in the works and slated for the

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.710
2022 HBO Max lineup.

00:06:15.710 --> 00:06:20.470
Between the cast and the adult tone projected,
The Suicide Squad looks to be a funny, bombastic

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:25.710
alternative to the the more serious side of
the DCEU, and -- true to its name -- already

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.220
promises a high body count.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.850
"We're all going to die."

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:29.870
"I hope so."

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:34.130
Seeming to follow in the chaotic footsteps
of Birds of Prey, the largely doomed team

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:37.780
of The Suicide Squad is coming to town on
August 6, 2021.

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:43.440
Reminiscence is an upcoming sci-fi thriller
starring Hugh Jackman that looks to be channeling

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:48.270
Inception, which isn't all that surprising
considering Reminiscence is a collaboration

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:53.490
between producer Jonathan Nolan and his wife,
director Lisa Joy, who previously co-created

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:55.050
HBO's Westworld.

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:58.139
Not much is known about the intriguing film
outside of its premise.

00:06:58.139 --> 00:07:02.740
Jackman plays Nick Bannister, an ex-military
man with certain professional skills.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:07.340
For the right price, he can offer the chance
for people to relive any memory they desire.

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:11.660
When he falls in love with Mae, played by
Rebecca Ferguson, things get complicated when

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:16.050
he gains access to her memories, and the truth
about her dark past starts to come to the

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.050
surface.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:21.380
If you like action, sci-fi, or thrillers,
Reminiscence is a can't-miss watch when it

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:24.670
comes to HBO Max on September 3, 2021.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:30.000
Only a few months after a new Conjuring movie
hits, we get Malignant, and it's sure to scare

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.419
our pants off.

00:07:31.419 --> 00:07:35.800
Aside from this being Conjuring universe creator
James Wan's first time directing a horror

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:41.120
movie since 2016's The Conjuring 2, it also
features a face that might be familiar to

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.550
audiences who absolutely love being terrified.

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:49.180
Annabelle Wallis, who is best known for her
role as Mia in the first Annabelle film, has

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:51.250
a starring role in Malignant.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:55.120
Wan has said that Malignant isn't based on
any pre-existing movie or story.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:08:00.430
It's a completely original horror thriller,
but beyond that, not a whole lot else is known.

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:02.570
It's probably best that way, too.

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:07.110
There's nothing better to a horror fan than
a completely surprising and terrifying moviegoing

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:08.110
experience.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:11.030
Get ready for some major scares on September
10, 2021.

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:18.110
Years after the ambiguous ending of The Sopranos,
fans of HBO's era-defining mob epic are finally

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:21.880
getting invited back into the life of Tony
Soprano and his family.

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.710
Only this time, it's a prequel.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:27.790
The Many Saints of Newark is a collaboration
between Warner Brothers and HBO Films that

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:31.570
was originally scheduled for theatrical release
in September 2020.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:35.209
Like many of the Warner Brothers features
on this list, The Many Saints of Newark was

00:08:35.209 --> 00:08:42.110
delayed exactly one year and will hit a simultaneous
release in theaters and streaming on HBO Max.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:47.309
This prequel to the acclaimed drama series
is set in the 1960s and '70s in New Jersey.

00:08:47.309 --> 00:08:52.160
Penned by Sopranos series creator David Chase,
The Many Saints of Newark aims to tell a story

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:54.790
about the 1967 Newark riots.

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:59.160
The film will focus on the racial tensions
between the Italian-American and African-American

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.970
communities of New Jersey and the Eastern
seaboard.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:07.110
The cast is loaded, with Corey Stoll as a
young Junior Soprano and James Gandolfini's

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:08.940
son, Michael, cast as a young Tony.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:14.370
Plus, we've got Vera Farmiga as Livia Soprano,
in addition to appearances from Jon Bernthal,

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:17.100
Leslie Odom Jr., and Ray Liotta.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:20.740
Sopranos fans will have a lot to be thankful
for this fall, when the gangsters make their

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:24.079
way to HBO Max on September 24, 2021.

00:09:25.079 --> 00:09:29.670
Denis Villeneuve's take on Dune is one of
the most hyped movies of 2021, following an

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:33.010
entire year of being one of the most hyped
movies of 2020.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:37.050
Still, the excitement persists with each morsel
of news that comes out.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:42.350
For sci-fi fans of many ages, Dune is a fundamental
work — a cornerstone of the genre — and

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.690
this version looks to get a lot of things
right where David Lynch's 1984 attempt to

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.149
adapt it failed.

00:09:48.149 --> 00:09:53.439
Timothee Chalamet takes the reins as Dune
hero Paul Atreides, and Oscar Isaac will appear

00:09:53.439 --> 00:09:56.230
as his father, Duke Leto Atreides.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:10:00.410
This will be the first entry in Villeneuve's
two-part adaptation of the first novel in

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:01.850
the Frank Herbert series.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:08.439
The rest of the cast includes Rebecca Ferguson,
Javier Bardem, Josh Brolin, Zendaya, Stellan

00:10:08.439 --> 00:10:11.410
Skarsgård, Jason Momoa, and Dave Bautista.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:16.179
So, if you're ready to visit the world of
Arrakis, just remember that fear is the mind-killer

00:10:16.179 --> 00:10:20.310
and that Dune will be hitting HBO Max on October
1, 2021.

00:10:21.329 --> 00:10:25.709
If you're a fan of films like Hang 'Em High,
The Outlaw Josey Wales, or The Good, the Bad

00:10:25.709 --> 00:10:29.009
and the Ugly, have we got some great news
for you.

00:10:29.009 --> 00:10:31.910
Cry Macho is the next Western from Clint Eastwood.

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:37.300
It's based on the 1975 book of the same name,
written by N. Richard Nash, who co-wrote the

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:41.319
screenplay in the '90s with Nick Schenk prior
to Nash's death in the year 2000.

00:10:41.319 --> 00:10:45.939
And as you've probably assumed, Eastwood is
not only showing up in front of the camera,

00:10:45.939 --> 00:10:47.950
but also sitting in the director's seat.

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:52.139
The film will be a neo-Western, meaning it's
set closer to the modern day than the heyday

00:10:52.139 --> 00:10:53.879
of cowboys in the 1800s.

00:10:53.879 --> 00:10:59.059
Still, we're pretty sure the Academy Award-winning
director of Unforgiven will handle the century

00:10:59.059 --> 00:11:00.770
change just fine.

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:04.839
Eastwood stars as a washed-up rodeo star and
20th century cowboy.

00:11:04.839 --> 00:11:10.399
In 1978, he takes a job from an ex-boss to
bring the man's young son home and away from

00:11:10.399 --> 00:11:11.879
his alcoholic mother.

00:11:11.879 --> 00:11:15.759
The film was shot in New Mexico in November
and December of 2020.

00:11:15.759 --> 00:11:19.750
If you're excited to see Eastwood back in
the proverbial saddle, Cry Macho will ride

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:22.690
onto HBO Max on October 22, 2021.

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:29.050
Slated as one of HBO Max's big releases of
the 2021 holiday season, King Richard is setting

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:31.459
itself up as an awards-season contender.

00:11:31.459 --> 00:11:36.990
The Warner Brothers biopic stars Will Smith
as Richard Williams, father of tennis superstars

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:38.769
Venus and Serena Williams.

00:11:38.769 --> 00:11:43.160
The film is a look at their father's influence
and how Richard coached them to success.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:47.730
King Richard features Saniyya [sa-NIE-ah]
Sidney and Demi Singleton as Venus and Serena,

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:48.730
respectively.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:53.649
Jon Bernthal, Tony Goldwyn, and Dylan McDermott
are also going to make appearances in supporting

00:11:53.649 --> 00:11:54.649
roles.

00:11:54.649 --> 00:11:59.509
Liev Schreiber was originally cast, but was
replaced by Goldwyn in October of 2020.

00:11:59.509 --> 00:12:02.970
Not much else is known about the film aside
from its talent and premise.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:07.160
The script was penned by Zach Baylin, and
Monsters and Men director Reinaldo Marcus

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.779
Green was brought on to helm the project.

00:12:09.779 --> 00:12:14.489
Anyone looking for more serious drama fare
on HBO Max is sure to perk their ears up when

00:12:14.489 --> 00:12:18.889
King Richard gets a release on the streaming
service later this year, especially Will Smith

00:12:18.889 --> 00:12:21.029
fans and tennis aficionados.

00:12:21.029 --> 00:12:23.319
The match begins on November 19, 2021.

00:12:24.739 --> 00:12:29.029
It's been quite a long time since we've seen
a new project set in the world of The Matrix.

00:12:29.029 --> 00:12:33.779
The pivotal cyberpunk franchise has laid dormant
since the multiplayer role playing game The

00:12:33.779 --> 00:12:36.899
Matrix Online went offline in 2009.

00:12:36.899 --> 00:12:41.959
But over a decade later — and nearly two
decades since the last movie — Lana Wachowski

00:12:41.959 --> 00:12:45.759
is returning to direct a fourth live-action
Matrix movie.

00:12:45.759 --> 00:12:51.730
While the film doesn't yet have a title, Resurrections
has been heavily rumored as a potential option.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:52.899
"Whoa."

00:12:52.899 --> 00:12:56.989
Although Lilly Wachowski worked with Lana
on the original Matrix trilogy, as well as

00:12:56.989 --> 00:13:01.829
most of the sisters' other projects, she is
not returning for this brand new Matrix film.

00:13:01.829 --> 00:13:06.199
The production on the fourth Matrix movie
was interrupted by the COVID-19 shutdown,

00:13:06.199 --> 00:13:09.949
but it resumed filming in the summer of 2020
and wrapped up in November.

00:13:09.949 --> 00:13:14.350
Of course, no matter how fascinating the world
of The Matrix is, a new Matrix movie would

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.999
be nothing without Neo.

00:13:15.999 --> 00:13:21.350
Thankfully, both Keanu Reeves and Carrie-Anne
Moss are returning to the series as Neo and

00:13:21.350 --> 00:13:22.350
Trinity, respectively.

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:26.540
Jada Pinkett Smith, Daniel Bernhardt, and
Lambert Wilson will also be reprising their

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.459
roles from the Matrix sequels.

00:13:28.459 --> 00:13:32.600
Sadly, Laurence Fishburne has gone on the
record saying he wasn't asked to return to

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.569
his iconic role as Morpheus.

00:13:34.569 --> 00:13:38.279
Still, the cast isn't without its fair share
of star power.

00:13:38.279 --> 00:13:44.320
Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Priyanka Chopra, Neil
Patrick Harris, and Jonathan Groff will all

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:49.829
be making appearances in the newest movie
when it releases on December 22, 2021.

00:13:50.829 --> 00:13:55.429
Based on the J.T. Rogers play that took the
world by storm in 2017 and won a Tony for

00:13:55.429 --> 00:14:01.149
Best Play, Oslo is an upcoming film adaptation
from producers Steven Spielberg and Marc Platt.

00:14:01.149 --> 00:14:06.170
Rogers wrote the screenplay, and the adaptation
is being directed by Bartlett Sher, who directed

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:09.699
Oslo on Broadway and earned a Tony nomination
for his work.

00:14:09.699 --> 00:14:14.360
With Andrew Scott of Fleabag and Ruth Wilson
of The Affair in the leading roles, this version

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:17.350
of Oslo is shaping up to be the real deal.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:22.249
The plot of the film will tell the story of
the secret 1990s Oslo Peace Accords between

00:14:22.249 --> 00:14:25.500
Israel and the Palestinian Liberation Organization.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:29.540
In other words, it's a story about people
from wildly different backgrounds trying to

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:33.779
build relationships and the struggles they
face due to overwhelming political turmoil

00:14:33.779 --> 00:14:34.779
and change.

00:14:34.779 --> 00:14:39.910
And since this film is based on an award-winning
play and backed by some very successful producers,

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:43.480
it's clear that HBO wants this project to
be a major hit.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:47.220
So while there's no release date for Oslo
yet, it's likely to hit the streaming service

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:51.120
later in 2021, just in time for awards season.

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:55.549
In the Same Breath is the first of two HBO
Films documentaries slated for release on

00:14:55.549 --> 00:14:58.399
HBO Max sometime in 2021.

00:14:58.399 --> 00:15:03.649
This one is HBO's exposé on the COVID-19
outbreak and how it specifically affected

00:15:03.649 --> 00:15:05.430
China and the United States.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:09.440
In the Same Breath takes a look at the government
response from each country and puts it in

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.230
a wider global context.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:17.880
The documentary premiered at Sundance in January
and SXSW Online in March to rave reviews.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:22.579
It currently holds an outrageously positive
average of 97% on Rotten Tomatoes.

00:15:22.579 --> 00:15:28.500
A passion project for Chinese-American director
Nanfu Wang, In the Same Breath focuses on

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:33.609
the widespread governmental failures in handling
the pandemic response by taking a deeper look

00:15:33.609 --> 00:15:36.249
at the two countries Wang has lived in.

00:15:36.249 --> 00:15:39.920
After receiving such a positive reception
following its festival premiere, hopefully

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:43.629
it will find its way onto HBO Max before the
end of 2021.

00:15:44.629 --> 00:15:49.910
Like the rest of Hollywood, HBO Films is champing
at the bit to capitalize on the GameStop stock

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:52.970
market anomaly that occurred early in 2021.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:57.850
Already, Hulu has released its documentary,
GameStopped, and a number of other projects

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:02.990
are in the works from other studios, including
an MGM film, two Netflix projects, and a feature

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:06.360
documentary by Console Wars director Jonah
Tulis.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:11.339
However, we're pretty sure that HBO's documentary
will be something special, given the studio's

00:16:11.339 --> 00:16:15.319
past track record for creating critically
acclaimed documentaries.

00:16:15.319 --> 00:16:19.939
While the project is still in its earliest
stages, Andrew Ross Sorkin of TBTF Productions,

00:16:19.939 --> 00:16:25.269
Len Amato of Crash&amp;Salvage, and Jason Blum
of Blumhouse are all on board to serve as

00:16:25.269 --> 00:16:27.249
executive producers for the film.

00:16:27.249 --> 00:16:31.989
TV fans probably know Sorkin best as co-creator
of the TV drama Billions.

00:16:31.989 --> 00:16:36.439
It's an interesting mix of producers that
will hopefully result in a fascinating exposé

00:16:36.439 --> 00:16:38.949
of one of the most interesting companies of
the year.

